{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21393","headline":"赋得数蓂 · 元稹","name":"赋得数蓂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将课司天历，先观近砌蓂。\n一旬开应月，五日数从星。\n桂满丛初合，蟾亏影渐零。\n辨时长有素，数闰或余青。\n坠叶推前事，新芽察未形。\n尧年始今岁，方欲瑞千龄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}